# QA report format

Append findings to `scripts/web.snapchat.com/docs/QA.md` as you hit them. Each finding must be specific and reproducible.

## Template

```md
### QA-NNN — short title
- **Area:** Reduck | Snapchat | Both
- **Severity:** P0 | P1 | P2 | P3
- **Steps:** 1. … 2. …
- **Expected:** …
- **Actual:** …
- **Workaround:** …
- **Date:** YYYY-MM-DD
```

Also note what **worked well** (agents, traces, promote flow, etc.) — balanced reports read senior.

Acknowledge Snapchat account-ban risk explicitly in the QA summary.
